- Compressor 01

## Supported fault scenarios

- `normal`
- `bearing_wear`
- `heat_excess`
- `pressure_spike`
- `coating_drift`
- `coolant_loss`
- `drive_misalignment`
- `electrical_fault`

## Notes

This simulator is intentionally lightweight and deterministic enough to be used for demos, dashboard prototyping, digital twin experiments, and predictive maintenance proofs of concept.

